@startuml

title Password Security Analyzer - Architecture Diagram

actor User

rectangle "Input Layer" {
    component "Password Input" as Input
}

rectangle "Analysis Layer" {
    component "Password Security Checks" as Checks
    component "Common Password Detection" as Common
    component "Score Calculation" as Score
    component "Strength Evaluation" as Strength
}

rectangle "Output Layer" {
    component "Result Generator" as Results
}

database "Persistent Storage" as Storage

User --> Input : Enter password

Input --> Checks : Password
Checks --> Common : Password
Checks --> Score : Check results

Common --> Score : Common password status

Score --> Strength : Score + common status

Strength --> Results : Strength result
Results --> User : Analysis results

Input ..> Storage : No password stored
note right of Storage
No persistent password storage
for security reasons
end note

@enduml